// A `TokenCreated` fact carries the token SPEC ([CR#701.7a]) — no minted
// object for a `what` filter to run against. KEPT cap under
// engine-one-evaluator: lifting needs a spec-side filter evaluator
// (pre-mint spec matching), a design of its own.
Normal(
  name: "Reject Bridge Token What",
  types: [Enchantment],
  abilities: [
    Triggered(
      event: TokenCreated(what: Type(Creature)),
      effect: GainLife(1),
    ),
  ],
)
